      "content": "hey... i need help understanding something weird. i was doing my internship at the lab last month and there was a leak in the particle stream chamber—nothing major, but i was right there when it happened. since then i've been seeing these... i don't even know how to describe them. like these colored clouds or streaks in my peripheral vision. like, yesterday i saw this heavy red mist right before a car almost clipped me in the parking lot. it's like i'm seeing something before it actually happens. is there some kind of neurological reason for this or is it related to the radiation?",
